WEBVTT

00:08:54.147 --> 00:09:04.139
(Frogs croaking)

00:09:04.163 --> 00:09:08.104
Mono Lake is just to the east
of Yosemite National Park

00:09:08.128 --> 00:09:09.933
in California,

00:09:09.957 --> 00:09:12.788
and it's a favorite
habitat of these toads,

00:09:12.812 --> 00:09:15.675
and it's also favored by U.S.
Navy jet pilots,

00:09:15.699 --> 00:09:18.721
who train in their fighters
flying them at speeds

00:09:18.745 --> 00:09:21.179
exceeding 1,100 kilometers an hour

00:09:21.203 --> 00:09:23.960
and altitudes only a couple hundred meters

00:09:23.984 --> 00:09:26.539
above ground level of the Mono Basin,

00:09:26.563 --> 00:09:30.213
very fast, very low, and so loud